{"id":"c922518c30c4107d","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-canonical-model.md","title":"Canonical Model","display":"df-canonical-model — Canonical Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-canonical-model","aliases":["89-df-canonical-model"],"display":"df-canonical-model — Canonical Model","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]]","[[89-df-kripke-model]]","[[89-lem-lindenbaum-modal]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-canonical-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-canonical-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-canonical-model — Canonical Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38f802289559e5da\" href=\"?note=38f802289559e5da\" title=\"89-df-modal-consistent-set\">89-df-modal-consistent-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"646a96fe655f6d74\" href=\"?note=646a96fe655f6d74\" title=\"89-lem-lindenbaum-modal\">89-lem-lindenbaum-modal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\notin L\">\\(\\bot\\notin L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> 为可数无限字母集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MCS}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{MCS}_L\\)</span> 为局部极大一致性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_L,R_L,V_L,\\mathcal M_L\">\\(W_L,R_L,V_L,\\mathcal M_L\\)</span> 为下文构造的载体、关系、赋值及模型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nW_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{MCS}_L(\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\nR_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\in W_L^2:\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(\\Box A\\in\\Gamma\\to A\\in\\Delta)\\},\\\\\nV_L(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\in W_L:p\\in\\Gamma\\}\\quad(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}),\\\\\n\\mathcal M_L&amp;\\coloneqq(W_L,R_L,V_L).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nW_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{MCS}_L(\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\nR_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\in W_L^2:\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(\\Box A\\in\\Gamma\\to A\\in\\Delta)\\},\\\\\nV_L(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\in W_L:p\\in\\Gamma\\}\\quad(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}),\\\\\n\\mathcal M_L&amp;\\coloneqq(W_L,R_L,V_L).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 85–88；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>保留原构造与适用条件。幂集分离保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_L\">\\(W_L\\)</span> 是集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\notin L\">\\(\\bot\\notin L\\)</span> 使空集局部一致，Lindenbaum 引理给一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in W_L\">\\(\\Gamma\\in W_L\\)</span>，所以载体非空。此存在证明是构造合法 Kripke 模型所需，本次将其真正补入直接依赖。关系分离与对每个字母的唯一集合定义给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_L\">\\(R_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_L\">\\(V_L\\)</span>。\n世界不要求对必然化闭合；只有 L 的定理可必然化。GL 的典范框架未必逆良基，第 5 章有限类型构造另用严格增加盒公式的关系，不能因本模型的真值引理而将其框架称为 GL 框架。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-consistent-set","status":"resolved","id":"38f802289559e5da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-lindenbaum-modal","status":"resolved","id":"646a96fe655f6d74","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-lindenbaum-modal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\notin L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MCS}_L","display":false},{"tex":"W_L,R_L,V_L,\\mathcal M_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nW_L&\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{MCS}_L(\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\nR_L&\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\in W_L^2:\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(\\Box A\\in\\Gamma\\to A\\in\\Delta)\\},\\\\\nV_L(p)&\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\in W_L:p\\in\\Gamma\\}\\quad(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}),\\\\\n\\mathcal M_L&\\coloneqq(W_L,R_L,V_L).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"W_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\notin L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in W_L","display":false},{"tex":"R_L","display":false},{"tex":"V_L","display":false}],"bytes":1681,"backlinks":[{"id":"f233d5485efaad7c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-canonical-model]]：逻辑的典范模型"},{"id":"170626a7dad88370","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-canonical-model]]：典范模型与过滤的对比"},{"id":"cf7dbabb97c0679f","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-canonical-model]]：典范模型（通常无限）"},{"id":"6f068c38418e21f2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f530ad4c65761317","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4f2c4a3e09c03374","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5ba20ee86fa7998c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-canonical-model]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]] → [[89-df-local-modal-consequence]] → [[89-lem-local-modal-deduction]] → [[89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties]] → [[89-lem-lindenbaum-modal]] → [[89-df-canonical-model]] → [[89-lem-canonical-successor]] → [[89-lem-canonical-truth]] → [[89-thm-canonical-model]]"}],"outgoing":["38f802289559e5da","ab746eb779e20ce0","646a96fe655f6d74"]}